","text":"\u003chttps://japan.zdnet.com/article/35165605/\u003e\nElasticsearchか。","ts":"1628595578.323100","attachments":[{"fallback":"ZDNet Japan: 「Elasticsearch」のライセンス変更でAWSが示した対応方針","id":1,"title":"「Elasticsearch」のライセンス変更でAWSが示した対応方針","title_link":"https://japan.zdnet.com/article/35165605/","text":"Elasticが「Elasticsearch」と「Kibana」のライセンスを非オープンソースのものに変更してから間もなく、AWSは、Elasticsearchのコードベースをフォークして、オープンソースのプロジェクトを立ち上げると発表した。","thumb_url":"https://japan.zdnet.com/storage/2021/01/27/a0fee1a3735f92659fae91bdf100c075/elasticsearch-logo-icon-lg_1280x960.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1611790200,"service_name":"ZDNet Japan","service_icon":"https://japan.zdnet.com/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":1280,"thumb_height":960,"from_url":"https://japan.zdnet.com/article/35165605/","original_url":"https://japan.zdnet.com/article/35165605/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FIWO2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"163a26b4-92d1-4dcd-9306-b2531295a58b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Amazon関連でAWSは使えないようにしようぜとか。","ts":"1628595557.322900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ohF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19674ea7-6077-46da-9853-e342007b9479","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"コントリビュータがいないか、 CLA でそこらへんちゃんとやっているか、何も考えていないかのいずれかだったりして","ts":"1628595547.322800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"348"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6a1bddf-4f65-4fa1-b5b5-7cddbbf12144","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"の割には世の中のプロジェクト気軽にライセンス変更してるなーと思うんですよね。","ts":"1628595521.321800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6G4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34e20d40-f2bd-466c-b81d-3850c0a89ee0","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あれそうでしたっけ?","ts":"1628595492.321200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_ori